      <h3><Icon name="link" /> WAN Connectivity &amp; VPN Services</h3>
      <p>
        When you need to connect locations that are <strong
          >too far apart for your own cables</strong
        >, you buy a WAN service from a provider. This guide explains every major WAN service type
        so a new tech can understand what they do, when to use them, and how they compare.
      </p>
      <div class="tip">
        <Icon name="lightbulb" />
        <strong>Think of it this way:</strong> Your LAN is your house. A WAN service is the road connecting
        your house to another house. Different road types (dirt road vs. highway vs. private road) offer
        different speeds, reliability, and costs.
      </div>
